,"posterShape":"poster","background":"https://lodynet.watch/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/deva-176x220.jpg","landscapePoster":"https://lodynet.watch/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/deva-176x220.jpg","logo":"https://lodynet.watch/wp-content/themes/Lodynet2020/Img/Logo.webp","description":"فيلم Deva 2025 مترجم — LodyNet Latest Drama & Series"},{"id":"cine_1215797","slug":"cinemana-1215797","type":"series","name":"Watashi no Shiawase na Kekkon","poster":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/F95035CF-CC63-3B0C-E90F-0BF6BFCEA803_poster.jpg","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/F95035CF-CC63-3B0C-E90F-0BF6BFCEA803_poster.jpg","landscapePoster":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/F95035CF-CC63-3B0C-E90F-0BF6BFCEA803_poster.jpg","description":"هل هذا الزواج نعمة؟ أم لعنة؟ وُلدت ميو سايموري بلا موهبة لعائلة نبيلة تشتهر بقدراتها الخارقة للطبيعة وأجبرت ميو سايموري على العيش في حالة من الاستعباد من قبل زوجة أبيها المؤذية. عندما بلغت ميو أخيرًا سن الزواج تلاشت آمالها في الانتقال بعيدًا إلى حياة أفضل بعد أن اكتشفت هوية خطيبها: كيوكا كودو وهو القائد البارد والقاسي على ما يبدو لدرجة أن عرائسه المحتملات قد هربن جميعًا في غضون ثلاثة أيام من إعلان الخطوبة. مع عدم وجود مكان تلجأ إليه تستسلم ميو لمصيرها\n\nBorn talentless to a noble family famous for their supernatural abilities, Saimori Miyo is forced into an existence of servitude by her abusive stepmother. When Miyo finally comes of marriageable age, though, her hopes of being whisked away to a better life crumble after she discovers her fiancé's identity: Kudou Kiyoka, a commander apparently so cold and cruel that his previous would-be brides all fled within three days of their engagements. With no home to return to, Miyo resigns herself to her fate—and soon finds that her pale and beautiful husband-to-be is anything but the monster she expected. As they slowly open their hearts to each other, both realize the other may be their chance at finding true love and happiness.","releaseInfo":"2023","imdbRating":"6.6","genres":["رسوم متحركة | Animation","دراما | Drama","خيالي | Fantasy","رومانسي | Romance"]},{"id":"3isk_watch__episodes__serie-halef-mudblj-season-2-episode-24","type":"series","name":"مسلسل الخليفة 2 مدبلج الحلقة 24","poster":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/halef-dub.jpg","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/halef-dub.jpg","landscapePoster":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/halef-dub.jpg","logo":"https://3esk.onl/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/3isk-logo.png","description":"مسلسل الخليفة 2 مدبلج الحلقة 24 — 3isk (قصة عشق)"},{"id":"akwam_series__5967__~d8~a8~d9~8a~d8~aa-~d8~a7~d9~84~d8~a3~d8~a8-~d9~85~d8~af~d8~a8~d9~84~d8~ac","type":"series","name":"بيت الأب مدبلج","poster":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/CjQXU.jpg","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/CjQXU.jpg","landscapePoster":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/CjQXU.jpg","logo":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ2vuGLv4zY3XpoN2jza2unCQ95xFfypfe-h3k3xteMbGxl7taw-ziXyNg&s=10","description":"بيت الأب مدبلج — Akwam (أكوام)","imdbRating":"8.0"},{"id":"lodynet_~d9~81~d9~8a~d9~84~d9~85-dil-dosti-aur-dogs-2025-~d9~85~d8~aa~d8~b1~d8~ac~d9~85","type":"series","name":"فيلم Dil Dosti Aur Dogs 2025 مترجم","poster":"https://lodynet.watch/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dil-Dosti-Aur-Dogs-2025-149x220.jpg","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://lodynet.watch/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dil-Dosti-Aur-Dogs-2025-149x220.jpg","landscapePoster":"https://lodynet.watch/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dil-Dosti-Aur-Dogs-2025-149x220.jpg","logo":"https://lodynet.watch/wp-content/themes/Lodynet2020/Img/Logo.webp","description":"فيلم Dil Dosti Aur Dogs 2025 مترجم — LodyNet Latest Drama & Series"},{"id":"cine_1141388","slug":"cinemana-1141388","type":"series","name":"Tensei Kizoku, Kantei Skill de Nariagaru","poster":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/321BA326-F1EF-FA4A-3A42-B905D4D07ED8_poster.jpg","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/321BA326-F1EF-FA4A-3A42-B905D4D07ED8_poster.jpg","landscapePoster":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/321BA326-F1EF-FA4A-3A42-B905D4D07ED8_poster.jpg","description":"رجل عادي في عالم آخر يمتلك قدرات سحرية، بعد أن مات في يومٍ ما وتجسد من جديد كـ “آرس لوفنت“، ابن نبيل. على الرغم من عدم امتلاكه مواهب في السحر أو فنون القتال، إلا أنه يتمتع بمهارة فريدة لا يمتلكها أحد آخر وهي “التقدير“. وباستخدام هذه القدرة، يمكن لـ”آرس” تحديد قوة الشخص الحالية ومدى إمكانياته، ومكان تفوقه. تكون هذه المهارة خاصة مفيدة في الوضع الراهن للبلاد، حيث الحكومة فاسدة، والثورات تحدث بشكل متكرر، والنبلاء في كل مكان يقوون حصونهم استعدادًا لحرب شاملة. ليدرك “آرس” أنه يجب عليه أيضًا التحضير من خلال جمع أشخاص موهوبين. وهكذا، المهاجر المضطهد الذي لا يُضاهى في فنون القتال، والفتاة التي كانت عبدة في السابق وتمتلك موهبة سحرية غامضة، والفتى المتردد الذي يشتاق بلا حدود للمعرفة، معا، يقدمون دعمهم ومساعدتهم لـ”آرس” في تحقيق هدفه في إنشاء أقوى إقليم\n\nAfter thirty-five years of perfectly ordinary life, a run-of-the-mill businessman suddenly drops dead...only to be reborn in another world! Now he must live as Ars Louvent, scion of a minor noble family and wielder of a fabulous skill: Appraisal, the power to perceive the strengths and abilities of others at a glance.\n\nHe'll need it, too, because there are plenty of problems to solve in the Louvent family's territory! Ars only has one choice: recruit the most talented individuals his skill can find, and rise up to new heights in his brand new world!","releaseInfo":"2024","imdbRating":"6.0","genres":["مغامرة | Adventure","رسوم متحركة | Animation","خيالي | Fantasy"]},{"id":"3isk_watch__episodes__serie-cift-kisilik-oda-mudblij-season-1-episode-35-b146n","type":"series","name":"مسلسل فندق الاحلام مدبلج الحلقة 35","poster":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Cift-Kisilik-Oda-Mudblij.jpg","po